# 静态资源缓存策略（Workers Static Assets 支持 _headers 文件）
# Static asset cache policy (Workers Static Assets reads _headers)
# 带 hash 版本号的 assets 可永久缓存，解决 APP 内嵌页面重复打开时重新下载的问题
# Hashed assets are immutable; speeds up reopening the page inside the APP shell

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache
